Sarah is planning to do some baking. She buys 5 pounds of rye flour, 10 pounds of whole-wheat bread flour, and 3 pounds of chickpea flour. Sarah already had some whole-wheat pastry flour at home. She now has 20 pounds of flour. How many pounds of whole-wheat pastry flour did she already have at home?
