\[
L_{\text{decay}} = \frac{1 \times 10^{-6}}{2\pi \sqrt{(0.3)^2}} = \frac{1 \times 10^{-6}}{2\pi \times 0.3} \approx 50 \text{ nm}
\]
Thus, the decay length is \(\boxed{50 \text{ nm}}\).
