\[
\frac{A}{B} = \frac{8 \pi h \nu_0^3 n^3}{c^3}
\]

and the definition of saturation intensity \( I_s \), the reflectivity can also be written as:

\[
R = \exp\left(\frac{h \nu}{kT}\right) - 1
\]

